  "question": {
    "text": "Only \\(2 \\mathrm{~mL}\\) of \\(\\mathrm{KMnO}_4\\) solution of unknown molarity is required to reach the end point of a titration of \\(20 \\mathrm{~mL}\\) of oxalic acid \\((2 \\mathrm{M})\\) in acidic medium. The molarity of \\(\\mathrm{KMnO}_4\\) solution should be \\(\\qquad\\) M."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { eq. }\\left(\\mathrm{KMnO}_4\\right)=\\text { eq. }\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\mathrm{O}_4\\right) \\\\ & \\mathrm{M} \\times 2 \\times 5=2 \\times 20 \\times 2 \\\\ & \\mathrm{M}=8 \\mathrm{M}\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}